+// Release P1 «Дом и дорога» (Claude, 17.10.2026). Owner 16.10: «жизнь вне службы как в Sims: ездить на работу, дома
+// самому решать, что делать; потребности». The officer lives somewhere: a rented flat or room in one of the districts
+// (prices of a small Estonian town, 2026), pays rent, bills and food every month, and goes to the station before every
+// shift — on foot, by bus or by own car. The way takes time (less rest), the bus may be late in snow, a tired officer
+// oversleeps; being late to the briefing is noted by the shift supervisor, three times in a month is a reprimand that
+// blocks the next rank for a while. The needs of the hero (rest, calm, fitness, company, money) are shown together.
